e":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"RfDHvt_s1vuR6dnhZ890Ig","review_id":"lzxv4aZofLXOHSk4lmcOow","date":"2017-09-27T17:10:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9411067962646484,"text_excerpt":"Shake Sugary is a great place to grab a morning muffin or pastry, which is something I definitely do on the regular . Their vegan muffin rotates daily and I am especially fond of the peach pistachio and blueberry; although really they're all good. I've ordered custom cakes from them in the past and they're always huge and delicious and you can customize them with whatever flavor combinations you want. They also make THE BEST KING CAKE. The cherry filled one is the stuff dreams are made of, and I look forward to being within walking distance from them during Carnival season this year so I can sashay myself over there to polish one off. My only complaint, if you can even call it that, is th..."},{"business_id":"RfDHvt_s1vuR6dnhZ890Ig","review_id":"VZEbr6AHwCLUuMWYb34PHw","date":"2014-11-24T19:06:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9213435053825378,"text_excerpt":"Let's start with the staff. They are just so cute and wonderful smiles. I like this about the location. It sits on St. Claude, so its pretty easy to get to in the Bywater. It's a mixed commercial and residential area. It is all street parking but its low foot traffic so you should definitely have no issues finding some place to park. Now to the goods. So many great options for all types of food lovers especially those with certain needs. There are a good majority options of Gluten Free pastries which I found interested. Im a GLUTEN eater so I was skeptical about the taste but they ended up being very yummy I must say and Im a person could care less if something is vegan and gluten free. T..."},{"business_id":"RfDHvt_s1vuR6dnhZ890Ig","review_id":"8440Mn6wsHHl2pCfe_PMyg","date":"2019-01-08T20:54:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.920561671257019,"text_excerpt":"My daughter brought me here for my birthday treat. I eat plant based and they had decent vegan pastry options. I got a coffee cake muffin and some type of a coconut bar. The muffin has a nice crumble on top and was moist in the middle. It did have some type of fruit inside that I didn't care for (I'm not a fan of fruit in baked goods. I also tried the coconut bar. It was really rich and had great flavor. The shop itself is small. It had a steady stream of customers. They also serve non vegan pastries and other menu items."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"RfDHvt_s1vuR6dnhZ890Ig","photo_id":"vHNlIh4fJ9vCPzaaqF7PPQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/vHNlIh4fJ9vCPzaaqF7PPQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.893693208694458},{"business_id":"RfDHvt_s1vuR6dnhZ890Ig","photo_id":"LHp5iqRpqf-MxXcJr-993A","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/LHp5iqRpqf-MxXcJr-993A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.878789484500885},{"business_id":"RfDHvt_s1vuR6dnhZ890Ig","photo_id":"tkV6oga73Nr6ztjXuLvJGQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/tkV6oga73Nr6ztjXuLvJGQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8301326036453247},{"business_id":"RfDHvt_s1vuR6dnhZ890Ig","photo_id":"PM-JNzWJEDC99ZxD7QqojQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photo